d": 446, "text": "Just as she was about to refocus on her notes, a knock at the door broke the silence."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 447, "end": 522, "text": "\"Come in,\" Sophia called out, expecting one of her students or a colleague."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 523, "end": 619, "text": "Instead, a woman with curly dark hair and a warm smile entered, carrying a worn leather satchel."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 620, "end": 624, "text": "\"Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 625, "end": 654, "text": "Patel, I'm Raquel Villamizar."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 655, "end": 829, "text": "I've just joined the university as a researcher in the biology department,\" she introduced herself, her accent a subtle blend of Latin American rhythms and British precision."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 830, "end": 860, "text": "Sophia's curiosity was piqued."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 861, "end": 892, "text": "\"Welcome to Manchester, Raquel."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 893, "end": 936, "text": "What brings you to our humble institution?\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 937, "end": 1060, "text": "Raquel's eyes sparkled as she began to unpack her satchel, revealing a collection of dog-eared journals and a sleek laptop."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1061, "end": 1108, "text": "\"I'm excited to collaborate with the team here."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1109, "end": 1198, "text": "My background is in microbiology, and I've been following your work on genetic mutations."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1199, "end": 1260, "text": "I think we could make some fascinating discoveries together.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1261, "end": 1424, "text": "As they delved into a discussion about the intricacies of gene expression, Sophia found herself drawn to Raquel's infectious enthusiasm and impressive credentials."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1425, "end": 1564, "text": "It wasn't until they exchanged contact information that Sophia noticed the ORCID identifier on Raquel's business card: 0000-0001-5225-0579."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1565, "end": 1710, "text": "A quick mental note was made to look up Raquel's publications later, but for now, Sophia was content to bask in the promise of a new partnership."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1711, "end": 1843, "text": "As Raquel departed, leaving behind a trail of freshly sharpened pencils and a hint of citrus perfume, Sophia felt a glimmer of hope."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1844, "end": 1916, "text": "Perhaps this chance encounter would be the catalyst her research needed."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Raquel A Villamizar", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Raquel A Villamizar has worked at the University of Pamplona.", "answer": "University of Pamplona", "quote": "Raquel A Villamizar has worked at the University of Pamplona.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Raquel A Villamizar", "scope": "work for", "claim": "Raquel A Villamizar worked for the University of Manchester, biology department.", "answer": "University of Manchester, biology department", "quote": "I've just joined the university as a researcher in the biology department,\" she introduced herself, her accent a subtle blend of Latin American rhythms and British precision.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University of Pamplona", "University of Manchester, biology department"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answe